# Review requirements. Branch protection on main requires an approval from a
# matching owner before merge. Later lines win for a given path.
#
# RAIS reviews everything by default.
*                       @raisdev/rais-reviewers

# The catalog and the automation stay with RAIS only.
/.claude-plugin/        @raisdev/rais-reviewers
/.github/               @raisdev/rais-reviewers
/scripts/               @raisdev/rais-reviewers
/site/                  @raisdev/rais-reviewers

# Department folders. Add a line per unit once its GitHub team exists.
# The unit's reviewers can approve their own plugins; RAIS still sees the PR.
# /plugins/osp-*/       @raisdev/osp-reviewers @raisdev/rais-reviewers
# /plugins/oria-*/      @raisdev/oria-reviewers @raisdev/rais-reviewers
# /incubator/osp-*/     @raisdev/osp-reviewers
